# AJS panel LAN ingress block — owned by this repository, not by a hand-edited host.
# Owner: AJS control-plane ops (see deploy/README.md). Source of truth: this file.
# Scope: 2261 (ajs-accountd admin API, bearer auth) and 18082 (dashboard preview) from
# 192.168.11.0/24 only. Gate ports stay loopback-only: acc-07's gate :13012 is NOT opened here.
# Rollback: delete the block below, then run `nft -f /etc/nftables.conf` on the host.
# Hot withdrawal (热撤, no file edit): nft delete rule inet egress input handle <h>
#   find <h>: nft -a list chain inet egress input | grep '2261'
#
# check-nftables-drift.sh compares only the rule line; comments are ignored.
#
# --- begin block: identical to the live /etc/nftables.conf ---
        # AJS 面板（2026-10-24，AJS-120）：内网直连 2261（ajs-accountd admin API，Bearer 鉴权）
        # 与 18082（dashboard vite preview）。只开 192.168.11.0/24；acc-07 的 gate 13012 仍只听 loopback。
        # 回滚：删本行后 nft -f /etc/nftables.conf 重载；热撤（不改文件）：nft delete rule inet egress input handle <h>
        ip saddr 192.168.11.0/24 tcp dport { 2261, 18082 } accept
